<title>FINLAND: Hackman falls to 1996 loss.</title>
<headline>Hackman falls to 1996 loss.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss after financial items		    23.6 vs 40.6 profit</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)			 8.59 vs 3.99 profit</p>
<p> Proposed dividend per (markka)		2.50 vs 3.00</p>
<p> Net sales					1,992.7 vs 2,061.5</p>
<p> Operating profit				  20.6 vs 94.4</p>
<p> Net financial items		    charge 44.2 vs 53.8 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			    51.1 vs 161.1</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses			   nil vs 17.3</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 27.4 vs 184.3</p>
<p> Taxes						 21.9 vs 52.4</p>
<p> Minority interest			 charge 6.5 vs 10.9 charge</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    37.2 vs 35.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish consumer goods group is Oy Hackman Ab.</p>
